  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845739,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Butagee de Iinja Nai (Foolish Little Girl Doesn't Know) - PlayStation\n\nDive into a quirky and unconventional dating simulation for the PlayStation with *Butagee de Iinja Nai*. You play as a young man unexpectedly thrust into a bizarre situation: tasked with helping five high school girls prepare for their exams during a summer break. However, this isn't your typical tutoring gig. Each girl possesses a unique and eccentric personality, and the summer promises a whirlwind of study sessions, unexpected events, and the potential for romance.\n\nGameplay revolves around managing your time, balancing study assistance with opportunities to get to know each girl better. Choices you make directly impact their exam performance and your relationship with them. Will you focus solely on their academic success, or will you pursue a romantic connection? Prepare for a humorous and heartwarming experience filled with unusual characters and a charmingly offbeat storyline. *Butagee de Iinja Nai* offers a refreshing twist on the dating sim genre, blending lighthearted comedy with genuine character development."
    },
